590
01:04:17.753 --> 01:04:20.256
She wept and wept

591
01:04:21.057 --> 01:04:26.063
until she became a river of tears
and leaped off her mountain.

592
01:04:27.396 --> 01:04:29.376
Flowing down the grassy slopes,

593
01:04:30.633 --> 01:04:32.874
