I am here with you.

695
01:15:28.757 --> 01:15:29.497
<i>Yes, but...</i>

696
01:15:31.460 --> 01:15:32.495
But what?

697
01:15:37.432 --> 01:15:40.242
Helped

698
01:15:45.974 --> 01:15:47.920
