709
01:19:16.351 --> 01:19:19.298
It is called a "gole gappa."

710
01:19:19.488 --> 01:19:22.662
A trip to Lahore is incomplete without it.

711
01:19:23.658 --> 01:19:25.399
<i>Was,</i>

712
01:19:26.361 --> 01:19:29.171
