741
01:23:16.658 --> 01:23:17.363
Come with me.

742
01:23:18.159 --> 01:23:20.230
- Come, come.
- We're coming.

743
01:23:38.513 --> 01:23:42.757
- Don't make a sound.
- Where are you taking us?

744
01:23:43.918 --> 01:23:46.228
