She belongs to someone else.

758
01:24:23.425 --> 01:24:24.529
Never.
Never!

759
01:24:25.293 --> 01:24:26.533
Let her go.

760
01:24:27.896 --> 01:24:29.398
I will come with you.

761
01:24:32.400 --> 01:24:34.971
If you really want me then,

762
01:24:35.170 --> 01:24:37.047
